  "title": "Intelligenzbolzen",
  "slug": "intelligenzbolzen",
  "summary": "A team project connecting exercise-sensing devices with an app to make physical activity more engaging.",
  "content": "<p>Our school robotics team developed Intelligenzbolzen around the idea of encouraging people to exercise. The project grew from the 2020/21 FIRST LEGO League theme and was also entered in Jugend forscht in 2021.</p><h3>Measuring movement</h3><p>We built sensor-equipped devices that connect to a phone over Wi-Fi. The app was designed to recognize and record exercises, show times and records in charts, and offer a two-player game.</p><p>The project combined electronics, sensor measurements and app development. It was shared team work; individual responsibilities still need to be described more precisely before publication.</p>",
  "tags": [
    "Microcontroller",
    "App",
    "Jugend forscht"
  ],
